ved Health Outcomes in Diabetes Management: An Observational Patient Program#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Harnessing Digital Initiatives for Improved Health Outcomes in Diabetes Management: An Observational Patient Program#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/HQ4BZFKG","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LKPUY3Z?page=1&annotation=QAWRU7QW","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LKPUY3Z?page=1&annotation=VBNYRTSA","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LKPUY3Z?page=1&annotation=A2AA7DYW","line":36}],"metadata":{"Title":"Harnessing Digital Initiatives for Improved Health Outcomes in Diabetes Management: An Observational Patient Program","Authors":"Bipin Sethi, Krishna Seshadri, Vaishali Deshmukh, Unnikrishnan Ag, Manash Baruah, Sanjeev Phatak, Samit Ghosal, Sachin Chittawar, Khushboo Aggarwal, Bharath Hs, Prashant Sada","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.7759/cureus.73093","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"Zyla is a medical artificial intelligence (AI)-based personalized care management app that assists the treating physician in improving the standard of patient care by offering the patients comprehensive and individualized care.This was a retrospective, observational program conducted through the Zyla app in the calendar year 2020. The Zyla app's objective is to assist the treating physician in improving the standard of patient care by giving them the choice of assembling a personalized team (consisting of clinical nutritionists, physiotherapists, and counselors over a virtual platform) that can offer patients comprehensive and individualized care","Findings":"A significant improvement in all glycemic parameters was seen with the use of the Zyla app along with numerical improvements in kidney function parameters and cholesterol status among patients.","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1h2jocs","at":1774939669447}},"smart_blocks:sethiHarnessingDigitalInitiatives2024a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02506529,0.02728277,0.01492747,-0.02024078,-0.06049505,-0.02259406,0.00062548,0.06738859,-0.05011903,-0.03321401,0.0316229,-0.03085439,0.00202828,0.07832864,0.00511712,0.0025452,-0.00082908,0.02475226,0.00334186,0.00690552,0.03753522,-0.05522744,0.03314141,-0.04218438,0.00979812,0.04565905,-0.01050448,-0.04939413,-0.05543064,-0.19828747,-0.04213723,-0.00271327,0.06152799,0.00966251,-0.05310329,-0.00392035,-0.05572777,0.09346702,-0.05876555,0.01003013,-0.01483303,-0.01434436,0.00100636,0.02629719,0.00058936,-0.08858112,-0.06101161,0.01525747,-0.06734113,0.00844587,-0.02669903,-0.03817311,-0.00620676,0.08790547,0.04165843,-0.02301368,0.06400374,0.04047468,0.01489964,0.03761502,0.03012534,0.09013997,-0.19854096,0.06862433,0.00388424,0.02269366,-0.06495187,-0.02940967,0.03558614,-0.0003615,0.00355977,0.00228772,0.07423034,0.00772203,0.00259836,-0.02558063,0.08913434,0.01241577,0.00848006,0.03382598,0.01019763,0.02205462,0.00472516,-0.03051663,-0.03151008,-0.01580763,-0.01135773,-0.08917405,0.07299912,-0.04364488,-0.04977161,-0.00047234,-0.0426488,0.00469896,-0.05001605,-0.03143268,-0.0177795,-0.01003299,-0.09861391,0.10753246,0.01108409,-0.02832889,0.00188376,-0.03994691,0.03644242,-0.06411012,-0.01230261,-0.07371426,-0.02318082,0.0262421,0.0025319,0.022757,0.0458402,0.01147077,0.02041962,0.07306816,0.06063346,0.04936619,0.04460091,0.02517928,-0.02299982,0.02736029,0.09602433,0.01602723,-0.01780292,0.00966145,0.02244568,0.09175239,-0.03577205,0.00419834,0.10386527,0.03098316,-0.06800785,-0.01665098,-0.01107019,0.00029377,-0.02275936,-0.02434709,-0.03209155,0.02557373,-0.05463625,0.01065349,-0.02271863,-0.10836932,-0.08140884,0.1216